 "text": "Hi, how are you doing right now? Mostly by deciding on a per person contribution and everyone pitching in. Some people set a total and let couple cover it themselves, but fewer people do that now. That' a fine offer. You could accept it and chip in extra for things like the venue. Or you could set your own target and let them know you'll cover the food. Not rude, honest. Just let them know as a gift would be appreciated. Then let them know it' your money and you' cover it. If they really can't, that's kind of the answer. That sounds fair. He'll hear it from someone they trust.",
